In addition, I'd like to[ request] that you all[ help] me to do this by not trying to 'snap me out of it' by[ mentioning] a bunch[ of] modern stuff to me whilst at an event. I believe that enough of you have my email[ address] and are[ friends] with[ me] on various forums, message boards and social networking sites...[ that] any out of character[ conversation can safely take place there at] any[ time.]
